他们会进行一场精心策划的比赛。

986
00:39:02.340 --> 00:39:03.940
Oh my gosh, they were so into it.
天哪，他们太投入了。

987
00:39:04.520 --> 00:39:07.420
Well, I guess Greg Daniels was particularly obsessed.
嗯，我想 Greg Daniels 特别着迷。

988
00:39:07.880 --> 00:39:17.380
In fact, our editor, Dean Holland, told me that the very first time he met with Greg to start editing an episode, within about 10 minutes, Greg said,
事实上，我们的剪辑师 Dean Holland 告诉我，他第一次和 Greg 见面开始剪辑剧集时，不到 10 分钟，Greg 就问：

989
00:39:18.040 --> 00:39:19.300
have you ever played Call of Duty?
你玩过《使命召唤》吗？

990
00:39:19.660 --> 00:39:21.160
And Dean was like, yeah.
Dean 说，玩过。

991
00:39:21.700 --> 00:39:24.780
And he said, Greg left the room and started a 20-person game.
他说，Greg 离开房间，直接开启了一场 20 人的游戏。

992
00:39:25.760 --> 00:39:27.300
Like, within 10 minutes.
真的，就在 10 分钟内。

