1367
00:57:32.900 --> 00:57:37.740
Now, Rain mentioned this in the DVD commentary, and I had to do a deep dive.
雷恩在DVD评论音轨里提到了这件事，我特意去深挖了一下。

1368
00:57:37.980 --> 00:57:39.320
I was like, what?
我当时心想，什么？

1369
00:57:39.320 --> 00:57:43.420
It sounds like a superhero fantasy type show.
听起来像是一部超级英雄奇幻剧。

1370
00:57:43.580 --> 00:57:43.740
Ready?
准备好了吗？

