我在网上查了查。

1372
00:57:45.220 --> 00:57:47.560
This is what IMDb had to say about it.
这是IMDb上关于它的介绍。

1373
00:57:47.720 --> 00:57:50.020
The Expendables was an NBC pilot.
《敢死队》是一部NBC的试播集。

1374
00:57:50.020 --> 00:57:55.960
It was about a scientist who creates two indestructible lifelike robots.
讲的是一位科学家创造了两个坚不可摧、栩栩如生的机器人。

1375
00:57:55.960 --> 00:58:00.780
