00:58:34.980 --> 00:58:35.900
We probably should.
我们大概应该去了。

1387
00:58:35.900 --> 00:58:43.740
This is one of my favorite all-time scenes of all time on any television show ever made, ever.
这是我个人有史以来最喜欢的电视节目片段之一，没有之一。

1388
00:58:43.960 --> 00:58:46.080
This is one of my favorite bits ever.
这是我最喜欢的桥段之一。

1389
00:58:46.460 --> 00:58:47.640
Crentist the dentiSt.
牙医克伦蒂斯特。

1390
00:58:48.080 --> 00:58:50.260
Your dentist's name is Crentist?
你牙医的名字叫克伦蒂斯特？

1391
00:58:50.420 --> 00:58:52.040
Maybe that's why he became a dentiSt.
也许这就是他成为牙医的原因。

1392
00:58:52.980 --> 00:59:01.420
There is a deleted scene where Michael Scott, Michael, he's like, Scott, and he starts seeing what all would name with Scott.
有一个删减片段，迈克尔·斯科特，迈克尔，他当时在想“斯科特”，然后开始列举所有叫斯科特的人。

1393
00:59:01.520 --> 00:59:01.840
Yes.
没错。

1394
00:59:01.960 --> 00:59:03.820
But he said none of them are occupations.
但他说了，他们都不是从事这些职业的。

1395
00:59:03.820 --> 00:59:10.520
Okay, so in the script, the Crentist dentist scene is word for word, you guys.
好了，在剧本里，克伦蒂斯特牙医那场戏是逐字逐句写好的，各位。

1396
00:59:10.760 --> 00:59:13.780
There is nothing improvised about this scene.
这一幕里没有任何即兴发挥。

1397
00:59:13.900 --> 00:59:16.300
This was all written by Paul Lieberstein.
这全都是保罗·利伯斯坦写的。

1398
00:59:16.760 --> 00:59:18.420
Paul, you are a genius.
保罗，你真是个天才。

1399
00:59:18.720 --> 00:59:20.120
It is perfection.
这简直完美。

1400
00:59:20.480 --> 00:59:21.560
And you're right.
你说得对。

1401
00:59:21.700 --> 00:59:27.860
There's a deleted talking head, and then there is even more to this scene in the script that is deleted.
有一个被删减的访谈片段，而且剧本里这一幕还有更多被删掉的内容。

1402
00:59:27.860 --> 00:59:34.480
So if you want to see, like, an extended version of this genius, please visit the deleted scenes.
所以如果你想看看这种天才表演的加长版，请去看看删减片段。

1403
00:59:34.860 --> 00:59:36.480
I love it so much.
我太喜欢它了。

1404
00:59:36.600 --> 00:59:39.920
We asked Rain about it, and he sent in this clip.
我们问了雷恩关于这件事的看法，他发来了这段视频。

1405
00:59:40.260 --> 00:59:41.660
All righty then.
好吧，那就这样。

1406
00:59:42.020 --> 00:59:43.840
Office Ladies podcaSt.
《办公室女士》播客。

1407
00:59:44.420 --> 00:59:44.880
Jenna.
珍娜。

1408
00:59:45.200 --> 00:59:45.720
Angela.
安吉拉。

1409
00:59:46.040 --> 00:59:47.420
Hi, it's me, Rainn Wilson.
嗨，是我，雷恩·威尔森。

1410
00:59:47.540 --> 00:59:48.080
Remember me?
还记得我吗？

1411
00:59:48.800 --> 00:59:49.440
Vaguely.
有点印象。

1412
00:59:49.440 --> 00:59:57.440
Everyone talks about the Crentist scene as being so spectacular, and I know that it's some of the funniest writing.
每个人都说克伦蒂斯特（Crentist）那一幕非常精彩，我也知道那是整部剧里最搞笑的桥段之一。

1413
00:59:58.980 --> 01:00:06.720
I think Paul Lieberstein wrote it in all of the Office, the dentist, Crentist, and that jousting between me and Michael.
我觉得那是保罗·李伯斯汀写的，关于牙医克伦蒂斯特，还有我和迈克尔之间的那种博弈。

1414
01:00:06.860 --> 01:00:16.740
But the scene afterwards where Dwight and Michael play this chess game and Michael pretends to give up his position to Dwight is absolutely masterful.
但随后的那一幕，德怀特和迈克尔下棋，迈克尔假装要把职位让给德怀特，那简直是神来之笔。

1415
01:00:16.740 --> 01:00:22.960
And I think Steve is, I mean, he's great in everything, but he just kills it.
我觉得史蒂夫——我是说，他演什么都棒，但这一段他演得太绝了。

1416
01:00:23.540 --> 01:00:25.820
And it's so subtle and underplayed.
而且处理得非常微妙，克制。

1417
01:00:27.840 --> 01:00:30.540
And I love how Game of Thrones it is.
我喜欢它那种《权力的游戏》的感觉。

1418
01:00:30.620 --> 01:00:36.260
I forgot that this whole episode is like these power plays and power ploys and who's going behind, who's back.
我差点忘了这一整集都是这种权力博弈和计谋，还有谁在背后搞小动作。

1419
01:00:36.420 --> 01:00:45.260
It's like Littlefinger and Valeris in Highgarden or whatever.
就像小指头和瓦里斯在高庭什么的。

1420
01:00:45.260 --> 01:00:47.920
I think I'm getting all the Game of Thrones names wrong.
我觉得我把《权力的游戏》里的人名都记错了。

1421
01:00:48.280 --> 01:00:58.480
But in the Red Keep, all the maneuvering, you know, the Lannisters and backstabbing and loyalty and you don't know whose side who's on.
但在红堡里，所有的那些权谋，你知道的，兰尼斯特家族的背叛、忠诚，你根本不知道谁站在哪一边。

1422
01:00:58.880 --> 01:01:01.280
And it's so fantastic.
那真是太精彩了。

1423
01:01:01.280 --> 01:01:09.440
But the thing that gets me every time is that the reason it all falls apart is that Dwight insults the Sebring.
